<reference id="kitControl-Nor" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">kitControl-Nor</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc "> This component can take two to four Boolean inputs (inclusive) and only returns <systemoutput class="+ topic/ph sw-d/systemoutput ">true</systemoutput> when all of its inputs are <systemoutput class="+ topic/ph sw-d/systemoutput ">false</systemoutput>.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><author translate="no" type="creator" class="- topic/author ">Claudia Serwe &lt;claudia.serwe@tridium.com&gt;</author><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "/></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section ">
    <image placement="break" width="500" href="../graphic/kitControl-Nor.png" class="- topic/image "/> <image placement="break" width="500" href="../graphic/kitControl-Nor2.png" class="- topic/image "/><p class="- topic/p ">The <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Nor</uicontrol> operator's response is as follows:</p><table class="- topic/table "><tgroup cols="3" class="- topic/tgroup "><colspec colname="c1" colnum="1" class="- topic/colspec "/><colspec colname="c2" colnum="2" class="- topic/colspec "/><colspec colname="c3" colnum="3" class="- topic/colspec "/><thead class="- topic/thead "><row class="- topic/row "><entry class="- topic/entry ">In A</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">In B</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">Output</entry></row></thead><tbody class="- topic/tbody "><row class="- topic/row "><entry class="- topic/entry ">false</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">false</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">true</entry></row><row class="- topic/row "><entry class="- topic/entry ">true</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">false</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">false</entry></row><row class="- topic/row "><entry class="- topic/entry ">false</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">true</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">false</entry></row><row class="- topic/row "><entry class="- topic/entry ">true</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">true</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">false</entry></row></tbody></tgroup></table><p class="- topic/p "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Nor</uicontrol> is available in the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Logic</uicontrol> folder
of the <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">kitControl</apiname> palette. </p>
    </section></refbody></reference>